@@ -1,5 +1,22 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Availability endpoints: `GET /rooms/:id/availability` for one room and
+  `GET /availability` to compare rooms, both returning the free slots of a
+  window and accepting a `durationMinutes` filter.
+- A rejected booking now returns free alternatives of the same length in
+  `details.suggestions`, so callers no longer have to guess another time.
+- Conflict detection now catches every overlap. It previously only looked at
+  the start of the new booking, so a booking that started before an existing
+  one and a booking that enclosed one were both accepted.
+- `PATCH /bookings/:id` checks for conflicts as well; it used to move a booking
+  onto an occupied slot without complaint.
+- The conflict check and the write now share a transaction, so two concurrent
+  requests for the same slot can no longer both succeed.
+- Bookings are rejected with 400 when `endsAt` is not after `startsAt`, and
+  with 404 when the room or the user does not exist (previously a 500).
+
 ## 1.0.0
 
 - Rooms, users, bookings and amenities endpoints.
